{"title": "Sentinel: Snare", "pageid": 21523, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sentinel:_Snare", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features", "Applies to Wild Shape"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sentinel_Snare.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Sentinel_Snare.webp/300px-Sentinel_Snare.webp, /w/images/6/69/Sentinel_Snare.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Sentinel_Snare.webp/300px-Sentinel_Snare.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Sentinel_Snare.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Sentinel: Snare</b> is a passive feature obtainable by the <a href=\"/wiki/Sentinel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sentinel\">Sentinel</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a>. Users of this feature are able to stop enemies in their tracks if you hit them with an <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attack</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you hit a creature with an <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attack</a>, it can no longer move for the rest of its turn. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Sentinel_Foe\"> Condition: Sentinel Foe </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sentinel_Foe_(Condition)\" title=\"Sentinel Foe (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Sentinel_Foe_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sentinel_Foe_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Sentinel_Foe_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Sentinel_Foe_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Sentinel_Foe_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Sentinel_Foe_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sentinel Foe\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Sentinel_Foe_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sentinel_Foe_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/16/Sentinel_Foe_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sentinel_Foe_(Condition)\" title=\"Sentinel Foe (Condition)\">Sentinel Foe</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Can't move. Restrained by an <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attack</a> from a Sentinel.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Sentinel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sentinel\">Sentinel</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Blythe\" title=\"Blythe\">Blythe</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cirian\" title=\"Cirian\">Cirian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Derysia\" title=\"Derysia\">Derysia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Eni\" title=\"Eni\">Eni</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Feona\" title=\"Feona\">Feona</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fustian\" title=\"Fustian\">Fustian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Glyria\" title=\"Glyria\">Glyria</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hoarding_Merregon\" title=\"Hoarding Merregon\">Hoarding Merregon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kevo_Phogge\" title=\"Kevo Phogge\">Kevo Phogge</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/M%27alice\" title=\"M'alice\">M'alice</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Merregon_Legionnaire\" title=\"Merregon Legionnaire\">Merregon Legionnaire</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mitchia\" title=\"Mitchia\">Mitchia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nov_Shmoz\" title=\"Nov Shmoz\">Nov Shmoz</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rycke\" title=\"Rycke\">Rycke</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Spaulder\" title=\"Spaulder\">Spaulder</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vengeful_Merregon\" title=\"Vengeful Merregon\">Vengeful Merregon</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Though this applies to druids in Wild Shape and does deal damage, the Damage Roll is empty/bugged as of Hotfix 19.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200616\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 884/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6835/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2182/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1033/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 758259/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.942      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.0